      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Kourtinacissus rochalizo.</em> A gargantuan, deceptively placid mound of mossy plant matter that lures creatures close with inviting vines — then crushes and devours anything it can reach, weapons included. Habitat: Forest &amp; Plains.</p><p><em>Source: Heliana's Field Notes P-002 (Loot Tavern)</em></p>",
